    "description": {
      "value": "You have suffered as a worker for the unscrupulous Lumber Consortium, laboring under harsh conditions in dangerous wooded regions of Andoran.\n\nChoose two ability boosts. One must be to Strength or Dexterity, and one is a free ability boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Athletics skill and the Forest Lore skill.\n\nYou gain the Assurance skill feat with Athletics."
